      "widgets_values": [
        "Needs a Treza API key: set TREZA_API_KEY before starting ComfyUI, or save the key in user/treza_api_key.txt.\nThe picture's max_cost_usd is 0.01, so only one of today's free pictures renders (5 a day). Once they are used up it stops with nothing spent.\nThe clip opens on the picture: 4 s, 9:16, about $0.28, capped at $0.50.\nChange seed to render again."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
